# Native home grid. 640x480 matches the deck capture (deck-home.png, 20:30, Bluetooth on, idle),
# 480x320 the Pi 3A+ capture (shot1.png, 18:13, Bluetooth off): their tile lists differ, so each
# size gets the list its board showed. Other sizes use the deck's list.
title home
wifi 70
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator 2048=fixture:2048_128.png
clock 20:30
bt on
@480x320 apps Settings Store CLI Python SSH "IP Panel"
@480x320 clock 18:13
@480x320 bt off
home
shot home
